	(text "D7 clamps input transients; C7 is the U2 input\ncapacitor. Q1 feeds the UV/OV divider and blocks\nreverse current into it; C27 filters PI_5V_SENSE\nand R24 bleeds it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
