		(uuid "bb17e380-2a01-507f-b0b7-3466c62869e2")
	)
	(text "U2 switches PI_5V to SYS_5V with UV and OV cut-off. OV trip: 5.28-5.47 V;\nU2 re-enables only below 4.8-5.0 V, so after a trip on a normal supply\nit stays off until power is cycled. R8 sets the current limit, C6 the\nstart-up slew rate. R9-R11 are 0.1%, 10 ppm/°C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.46 93.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b2033528-af55-57f7-9d34-6c54a52c9b73")
	)
	(text "C8 is the U2 output capacitor.\nR12 bleeds SYS_5V (5 mA)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 210.82 93.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3f8c91c1-3d5e-5838-8a85-b78cadbf95eb")
	)
	(text "EXP_3V3 regulator (U4)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 113.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a73c6eb6-42b7-5cff-9740-1136ea60a64c")
	)
	(text "U4 makes EXP_3V3 for the expansion connectors on sheet 6 (Fixed\nexpansion connectors), so accessories do not load the host 3.3 V rail.\nSHDN is tied to IN, so U4 runs whenever SYS_5V is up; SENSE is tied\nto OUT. C9 is the U4 input capacitor, C10 the output capacitor."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 180.34 128.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e58b266f-6792-574c-bbd2-c58d0e2d7930")
	)
	(text "Notes"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f8b42e94-a65f-55db-947a-42f3010bf8e6")
	)
	(text "1. PI_5V: host 5 V from header pins 2 and 4 on sheet 1 (Host interface).\n2. SYS_5V: eFuse-protected 5 V for U4, the motor supply and supervisor on sheet 3 (Motor isolation and\n   current limits), the safety LDO and servo switch on sheet 4 (Independent safety supervisor), the LED\n   driver and underlights on sheet 5 (Underlighting), and the sensor switch, I2C repeater and over-voltage\n   protector on sheet 7 (Protected external signals).\n3. EXP_3V3: 3.3 V for the expansion connectors on sheet 6 (Fixed expansion connectors)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 171.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "abc683e5-8025-5749-8180-bc7a2013c85e")
	)
